  "review": {
    "note": "Retired the completed journal-v4-to-v5 offline CLI and shipped module in Ingest 0.30.0; normal journal v5 and runtime facade contracts are unchanged. The explicit local Core 0.44.0 wheel (SHA256 8c78e6deb328421e5bb0e3c92fe1357f127a899f548267b775d4c006a896db0d) passed all 7 targeted package and v3/v4 journal rejection tests; Core 0.43 remains admitted and its same tests also passed. PyPI Core 0.42.2 remains excluded because it lacks schema 9. All external candidates match the prior audit except Hypothesis 6.168.2: the official changelog still ends at 6.168.1, so checksum-verified PyPI source archives were compared. The change atomically replaces the constants cache to prevent truncated reads between concurrent workers; the optional Windows/Emscripten zoneinfo/all tzdata minimum changed to 2026.4 and these extras are not requested here. Installed 6.168.2 passed all 3 incremental property tests. Final exact-tree full gate and live lifecycle validation remain separate evidence.",
